==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|chn|en}} {{m|chn|potlatch||to give”; “gift}}, from {{etyl|nuk|en}} {{m|nuk|p̕ačiƛ||to give in ceremony}}. Compare {{m|en|potluck}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈpɒtˌlætʃ/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈpɑtˌlætʃ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A [[ceremony]] amongst certain indigenous peoples of the [[Pacific]] [[northwest]] in which [[gift]]s are [[bestow]]ed upon guests and personal property is destroyed in a show of wealth and generosity.
# A communal meal to which guests bring dishes to share; a [[potluck]].

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|communal meal}} {{l|en|potluck}}

